en.mobile_help.platform_specific.hint:
Purpose and behavior
Configure platform-specific behavior. Each adapter reads its own options; one platform setting does not automatically apply to others.

Effect and applicability
This changes the behavior described above and applies only when the selected service, runner or platform supports and enables this option. Review the draft before saving.

Example
{
  "telegram": {
    "pre_ack_emoji": {
      "enable": true
    }
  }
}
Format example, not a replacement recommendation. Substitute existing server IDs, addresses and resources. An empty object means edit its children.

